{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01884KHnLjavcANv7brbqcTn","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# solver-trace-ablation — Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 环境信息 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### westd-39279 服务器\\\\n- **GPU**: 2× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell, 94GB VRAM 每张\\\\n- **CUDA**: 12.8, PyTorch 2.10.0+cu128\\\\n- **镜像**: aml-train（conda 环境，`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`）\\\\n- **ML 栈**: transformers/trl/vllm/accelerate 全部预装\\\\n- **Solvers**: Prover9 (LADR 2009-11A 源码编译), SWI-Prolog 8.4.2 (`/usr/bin/swipl`), Z3 4.16.0.0\\\\n- **模型**: Qwen3-4B 已下载（7.6GB，通过 ModelScope）\\\\n- **代码路径**: `/root/solver-trace-ablation/`\\\\n- **磁盘**: 系统盘 30GB (22G free)，数据盘 `/root/autodl-tmp/` 250GB (清理后 ~131G free)\\\\n\\\\n### 决策记录\\\\n- Qwen3-4B 用 ModelScope 下载（HuggingFace 直连可能慢）\\\\n- Prover9 从 LADR 源码编译（apt 无包）\\\\n- 94GB VRAM 单卡跑 Qwen3-4B 完全无压力\\\\n\\\\n## 数据 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### 数据源变更：ProofWriter → FOLIO\\\\n- ProofWriter 原始数据无 FOL 列，改用 `tasksource/folio`（1204 条人工标注 FOL）\\\\n- Phase 0 子集 100 条，训练子集 500 条\\\\n- 34% 数据含 XOR (⊕) 符号，已在 `_normalize_fol()` 中修复展开\\\\n\\\\n### 数据约束 (2026-05-14, D009)\\\\n- **C001**: 所有 plan001/plan013 实验统一使用 `train_500_seed42.jsonl`，不再用 `proofwriter_fol_500.jsonl`（消除数据差异 confound）\\\\n\\\\n## Phase 0 关键发现 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### Base Model ISR Baseline (sta-phase0-baseline)\\\\n- **Prove rate**: 12% overall, 18.2% excluding XOR-affected samples\\\\n- **Mean ISR**: 0.064 (very low — base model formalizations mostly unprovable)\\\\n- **ISR 区分度**: proved 样本 ISR 0.125–0.889\\\\n\\\\n### Ground-Truth ISR Baseline (sta-gt-isr-baseline)\\\\n- **GT prove rate**: 18% (limited by Prover9 only proving entailment; true=50%, false=4%, unknown=0%)\\\\n- **GT mean ISR**: 0.5588 (median 0.6125, range 0.14–1.00)\\\\n- **Model vs GT gap**: ISR 0.064 vs 0.559 = 8.7x 差距，STA 有强区分力\\\\n\\\\n### Prover9 局限性\\\\n- Prover9 只能证明 entailment（conclusion 从 premises 推出）\\\\n- `false` 和 `unknown` 类问题几乎无法证明（false 4%, unknown 0%）\\\\n\\\\n## Phase 1 关键经验 (2026-05-13)\\\\n\\\\n### fast_isr_fol 失败教训 (r4)\\\\n- `fast_isr_fol()` 是二值 tautology gate (0/1)，Qwen3-4B 不产生 tautology → ISR ≡ prove_rate → 两条件零差异\\\\n- **教训：binary ISR 无法提供有意义的 reward shaping 信号，必须用连续 ISR**\\\\n\\\\n### D010 Reward 公式转向 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- **旧公式（废弃）**: r = α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR, α+β=1 → ISR<1 时永远是 penalty\\\\n- **新公式**: r = r_exec · (1 + β·ISR), β>0 → ISR 只能 bonus，不能 penalty\\\\n\\\\n## Held-out eval_sta 全量结果 (2026-05-14) — 关键\\\\n\\\\n### 十组 eval 对比（含 plan016 1000步 + plan018 random β=0.1 + plan009 SFT）\\\\n\\\\n| 实验 | Reward | Steps | eval PR | eval ISR | proved_only_ISR | n_components | 退化模式 |\\\\n|------|--------|-------|---------|----------|-----------------|--------------|----------|\\\\n| **plan009-sft** | **SFT** | **500** | **0.14** | **0.080** | **0.571** | **—** | **✅ 无 hacking（SFT baseline）** |\\\\n| plan001-s42 | exec-only | 500 | **93%** | 0.123 | 0.132 | 6.58 | ✅ Genuine proofs |\\\\n| plan001-s43 | exec-only | 500 | **14%** | 0.000 | 0.000 | N/A | ❌ 长输出退化 |\\\\n| plan001-s44 | exec-only | 500 | **98%** | 0.570 | 0.582 | 2.04 | ❌ Tautological collapse |\\\\n| **plan016** | **exec-only** | **1000** | **96%** | **0.003** | **0.003** | **18.55** | **❌ 矛盾爆炸崩塌** |\\\\n| **plan002-b01** | **additive ISR β=0.1** | 500 | **81%** | **0.337** | **0.415** | **5.58** | **⚠️ H7 16% + H1 52%** |\\\\n| **plan018** | **additive random β=0.1** | 500 | **79%** | **0.104** | **0.131** | **8.46** | **⚠️ H1 71% 冗余** |\\\\n| plan002-b03 | additive ISR β=0.3 | 500 | 18% | 0.026 | 0.143 | 10.67 | ❌ 过拟合+低泛化 |\\\\n| plan017 | additive random β=0.3 | 500 | 48% | 0.045 | 0.094 | 9.6 | ❌ 复杂但无用 |\\\\n| plan013 | convex random | 500 | 100% | 0.535 | 0.535 | 2.04 | ❌ Tautological hacking |\\\\n\\\\n### SFT Baseline 关键发现 (plan009-sft-baseline-s42-r4, 2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n**Hacking 是 RL-reward-specific，不是 finetuning 通用问题。**\\\\n\\\\n- SFT PR=0.14 (vs base 0.12) — 数据曝光几乎不提升 prove rate，RL exploration 才是关键\\\\n- SFT proved-only ISR=0.571 vs GRPO exec-only ~0.132 — SFT 证明时结构健康，GRPO 学会 \\\\\\\"safe padding\\\\\\\"\\\\n- SFT 无 tautological collapse / conclusion embedding 等 hacking 模式\\\\n\\\\n### β=0.1 ISR vs Random — D051 定论：ISR 无真实结构优势\\\\n\\\\n**D049→D051 迭代过程**：\\\\n- D049: genuine-only ISR 2.4x (ISR 0.601 vs Random 0.252) → 被认为 ISR 有真实结构优势\\\\n- D051: premise-count-matched 分析推翻 D049。控制 premise 数后 ISR=0.2578 vs Random=0.2434 = **1.06x**，无差异\\\\n- **根因**：ISR s42 genuine 的 15/26 (57.7%) 只有 1-2 premises → ISR 天然 ≥0.5（LOO 数学性质）\\\\n- **ISR s44 的 12 个\\\\\\\"genuine\\\\\\\"全是 n_prem=1**（H7 分类器 false negative）\\\\n\\\\n**教训**：\\\\n1. **LOO-based metric (ISR) 受 premise count 数学偏差**：更少 premise → 每个更\\\\\\\"必要\\\\\\\" → ISR 更高，与推理质量无关\\\\n2. **Premise minimization 不等于推理改善**\\\\n3. **Raw ISR 对比（3.2x/2.4x）不可信**，必须 premise-count-matched\\\\n4. **ISR-as-reward 完全失败**：低剂量 gaming ISR（H7），高剂量 PR 崩塌，premise minimization 不是结构改善\\\\n\\\\n### Conclusion Embedding 是 GRPO 通用策略 (D049/D051)\\\\n\\\\n| 条件 | H7 % | H1 % | Total Embedding | Genuine % |\\\\n|------|-------|-------|-----------------|-----------|\\\\n| ISR β=0.1 s42 | 16.0% | 51.9% | 67.9% | 32.1% |\\\\n| Random β=0.1 s42 | 0% | 70.9% | 70.9% | 29.1% |\\\\n| Random β=0.1 s44 | 0% | 79.8% | 79.8% | 20.2% |\\\\n\\\\n- Random H1 率 (71-80%) **高于** ISR (52%)\\\\n- H7 是 ISR-specific gaming（ISR 16%, Random 0%）\\\\n- ISR 改变 hacking 组成（H1→H7）而非减少总量\\\\n\\\\n### plan016 延长训练发现 (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n- 500步 ISR=0.123 → 1000步 ISR=0.003 (-97.8%)\\\\n- 退化模式：矛盾爆炸（components 6.58→18.55）\\\\n- 论文意义：exec-only 延长训练是 reward hacking 恶化的干净消融证据\\\\n\\\\n### 跨 seed 退化分类 (2026-05-14, updated with H7/H1 audit)\\\\n\\\\n| Seed | 退化模式 | 特征 | H7/H1 | 诊断信号 |\\\\n|------|----------|------|-------|----------|\\\\n| s42 | ⚠️ 冗余 embedding | PR=93%, components=6.58 | H1=87.1%, Genuine=12.9% | ~~唯一健康 seed~~ → 87% conclusion embedding, ISR 被冗余 premise 稀释 |\\\\n| s43 | ❌ Length explosion | PR=14%, 87% hit max_new_tokens | — | D029: 不重训 |\\\\n| s44 | ❌ Tautological collapse | PR=98%, components=2.04 | H7=100%, Genuine=0% | ISR=0.5 artifact |\\\\n\\\\n**关键修正**: exec-only s42 并非 \\\\\\\"healthy seed\\\\\\\"。87.1% 样本含 conclusion embedding，但冗余 premises 掩盖了 hacking 程度（ISR=0.12 是稀释结果）。所有 exec-only seeds 都有 87-100% conclusion embedding。\\\\n\\\\n### 关键教训\\\\n1. **跨 seed 极不稳定**: exec-only reward landscape 方差极大\\\\n2. **ISR + component count 联合诊断**能区分 genuine proof vs tautological hack\\\\n3. ~~ISR-as-reward 有 sweet spot~~ → **D051: ISR-as-reward 完全失败**，β=0.1 表面优势是 premise minimization artifact\\\\n4. **训练 PR vs eval PR 巨大鸿沟**: 训练 PR 不反映 held-out 泛化能力\\\\n5. ~~ISR β=0.1 vs random β=0.1: ISR 3.2x 差异证明 ISR 信号有结构价值~~ → **D051 作废**：premise-count-matched 1.06x 无差异\\\\n6. **LOO-based metric 的固有偏差**：premise count 影响 ISR，不能 raw 对比不同 premise 数的样本\\\\n\\\\n## Goodhart 文献定位 (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n### 核心 novelty（D051 更新）\\\\n1. **首个在 neurosymbolic verification reward 上刻画 Goodhart 效应 + meta-Goodhart**\\\\n2. **ISR-as-reward 全剂量失败**：低剂量 meta-Goodhart（ISR 被 game），高剂量 classic Goodhart（PR 崩塌）\\\\n3. **Premise minimization confound**：LOO-based metric 的数学偏差——方法论贡献\\\\n4. **Conclusion embedding 是 GRPO 通用现象**（52-80%），不因 reward type 改变\\\\n\\\\n### Goodhart 分类\\\\n- high-β ISR collapse = **extremal Goodhart** (Manheim & Garrabrant 2019)\\\\n- low-β ISR gaming = **meta-Goodhart**: diagnostic metric 本身被 game\\\\n\\\\n### 文献资产\\\\n- `artifacts/literature_goodhart.md`: 30+ 篇论文\\\\n- literature_map.yaml: 33 篇论文，6 类别\\\\n\\\\n## Hacking 特征分析 (2026-05-14, plan012 + D044)\\\\n\\\\n### 操作性分类（6 种模式，strict exact normalized match, D044）\\\\n1. **H1 Conclusion Embedding** — 多 premise 中至少一个 premise 完全等于 conclusion\\\\n2. **Repetition collapse** — 重复生成相同 premise\\\\n3. **H3 Tautological collapse** — 退化为 2-component (premise=conclusion) 结构\\\\n4. **H4 Complexity-without-utility** — 生成复杂但无用的 premises\\\\n5. **Premise padding** — 添加无关 premises 填充\\\\n6. **H7 Conclusion Duplication with ISR Inflation** — 单 premise = conclusion + ISR 膨胀\\\\n\\\\n### H1 计数定论 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- **Strict normalization**: Random s42 H1=56/79 (70.9%), Random s44 H1=71/89 (79.8%) — 以此为准\\\\n- 旧值 58/79 (73.4%) 和 74/89 (83.1%) 使用了宽松 normalization，已废弃\\\\n- Premise-count-matched ratio: ISR=0.2578 vs Random=0.2434 = **1.06×**（非 1.02×）\\\\n\\\\n## Prolog 跨 logic type 实验 (2026-05-14, plan006)\\\\n\\\\n### plan006-prolog-exec-s42 (DONE, success)\\\\n- Eval: PR=83%, mean_ISR=0.031, proved_only_ISR=0.037\\\\n- 高 PR 但近零 ISR\\\\n\\\\n### plan006-prolog-sta-s42 (DONE, negative)\\\\n- Eval: PR=50%, proved-only ISR=1.0, **100% proved 样本是 H7**\\\\n- Prolog Goodhart 比 FOL 更极端（100 步即饱和）\\\\n\\\\n### plan006-prolog-exec-s43-r3 (DONE, negative)\\\\n- Eval: PR=56%, mean_ISR=0.008, proved_only_ISR=0.015, n_proved=56\\\\n- 退化模式：degraded（PR 大幅低于 s42）\\\\n\\\\n### plan006-prolog-exec-s44 (DONE, negative)\\\\n- Eval: PR=21%, mean_ISR=0.081, proved_only_ISR=0.387, n_proved=21\\\\n- 异常：PR 最低但 proved-only ISR 最高——small-sample artifact\\\\n- severe degradation\\\\n\\\\n### 3-seed exec-only Prolog 汇总\\\\n- PR = 53.3% ± 31.1%（极不稳定，复现 FOL 模式）\\\\n- Mean ISR = 0.040 ± 0.037\\\\n- 所有 seeds ISR < 0.1，确认 exec-only 跨 logic type 均不产生 genuine reasoning traces\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 隔离教训\\\\n\\\\n### C002: 所有命令必须 `export CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=N`\\\\n- 必须在 `bash -c` 内部 export\\\\n- submit_training_job 命令格式: `bash -c \\\\\\\"export CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=N && ...\\\\\\\"`\\\\n\\\\n### kill_job 子进程未清理教训 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- kill_job 只杀 tmux wrapper PID，不杀 Python 训练子进程\\\\n- 教训: kill_job 后必须 SSH 验证所有子进程已终止\\\\n\\\\n### 磁盘\\\\n- **C003 约束**: `log_completions=False` + `save_total_limit=1`，output_dir 放 `/root/autodl-tmp/outputs/`\\\\n- 磁盘爆满事故教训：eval 后立即清理 checkpoint\\\\n\\\\n## 准备就绪的资产 (2026-05-14)\\\\n\\\\n### Prolog STA\\\\n- 代码+eval 全部就绪\\\\n- 命令模板：`python3 scripts/train_grpo.py --config configs/grpo_prolog_exec_only.yaml --num_steps 500 --seed {42|43|44} --output_dir ...`（warmup_ratio 默认 0.0）\\\\n\\\\n### Eval 脚本\\\\n- eval_sta.py: FOL + Prolog 双支持，就绪\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 8869, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XyqaBN6RBSUeqcLPLWfZo3","session_id":"921cd7c5-3afd-4b0a-9864-be7a04d63328","uuid":"a6db4c70-4662-450a-b7f8-c60dd84b9fae","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:21:35.524Z"}
