{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YQxV4ygkjh72pQVQsM49jj","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| plan006-prolog-sta-s44 | Prolog exec+STA GRPO seed=44: 第三 seed。3-seed mean±std 用于论文 Claim 3 跨 logic type 统计支撑。 | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **plan006-prolog-sta-s43** (negative): Prolog exec+STA GRPO seed=43: 跨 seed 稳定性检查。与 exec-only s43 对照。\\\\n- **plan016-extended-1000-s42** (success): Extended training 1000 steps exec-only: plan001-s42 500步 PR=93% 是真收敛还是 lucky early convergence? 1000步观察 PR 和 ISR 在更长 horizon 的行为。s43(14%)/s44(98% tautological) 在 500 步均失败，延长训练是否能改善？ ← 基于 plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n  [plan016-extended-1000-s42-submission-spec](/api/workspace-files/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/plan016-extended-1000-s42/report/plan016_submission_spec.md)\\\\n- **plan002-additive-b01-s42** (success): — ← 基于 plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n  [plan002-additive-b01-s42 训练命令](/api/workspace-files/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/plan002-additive-b01-s42/report/plan002-additive-b01-s42_prep.md)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 11 / 负向 18 / 失败 18 / 共 49\\\\ngenuine_count: 0 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\ngenuine_rate: 0 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-39279: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s42-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan006-prolog-exec-s43: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- plan018-additive-random-b01-s43: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan009-sft-baseline-s42: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- plan009-sft-baseline-s42-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan009-sft-baseline-s42-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan006-prolog-exec-s43-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2093, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UpX4qoAkB7LrqgPenCJ96b","session_id":"921cd7c5-3afd-4b0a-9864-be7a04d63328","uuid":"02f8638d-8df3-4ab7-ae21-a99efd127fe7","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:21:55.282Z"}
